Date: Wed, 31 Jan 2024 15:42:07 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 0533/1695] dts: stm32mp15: add low power modes and regulator
 levels

Add to the boards the pwr node to define the supported low
power mode and the specific low power states of all
board regulators.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 33c84c25984ff983e41e07a1d2f29bc531181a4b dts: stm32mp15: add low power modes and regulator levels]
Change-Id: I71687404231680e93ae00b0b6b6ab39ab9a4ce3d
Signed-off-by: Lionel Debieve <lionel.debieve@foss.st.com>
Signed-off-by: Pascal Paillet <p.paillet@st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/358379
Domain-Review: Patrick DELAUNAY <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Patrick DELAUNAY <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
